'' TKO0660 for a PACKED argument: a UDT casting only to 'double', packed into a typed variadic
'' of a type with several numeric constructors, reaches them all equally (fbc's 98 for the
'' same argument to a plain parameter). The check skipped array parameters, so a packed one
'' went unreported and lowering took a constructor and crashed. Spelled with its own cast it is
'' fine. See CtorTieArg_ in symbols/checkdecide.tiko.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/typed-variadic-ctor-tie.tiko
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: typed-variadic-ctor-tie.tiko(29,10): error TKO0660
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 1
